WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.340
Hi, I'm Gia.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:03.000
Before I worked with Leadvela,

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.501
I'd scroll through old messages

00:00:04.451 --> 00:00:06.031
trying to remember who I needed

00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:07.040
to follow up with.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:09.300
Their team set up GoHighLevel for me,

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.929
and now I can see who's waiting

00:00:10.879 --> 00:00:12.790
for a reply as soon as I log in.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.900
That's made my mornings a lot easier.

